      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "issue",
      "cat-harness:section": "关注点分离 —— 现状与未来规划",
      "prov:value": "当前该仓库是**同一检出（checkout）中的工具仓库兼内容仓库**。Issue\n[#223](https://github.com/litlfred/folio-assistant/issues/223) 规划将其拆分为五个可组合的 folio-assistant 实例。各子页面分别阐述了相关内容：",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "#223"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "docs/concepts/zh/architecture.md#provenance-2",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "issue",
      "cat-harness:section": "访问控制 —— ODRL，在每项任务前执行检查",
      "prov:value": "系统中存在统一的权限体系，即 W3C ODRL 2.2（issue #1180）：操作定义在 `skills/permissions/permissions.json` 中，授权定义在 `policies/*.jsonld` 中，由 `schemas/odrl.ts` 中的 `permits()` / `decide()` 进行评估。有两个调用方会对其进行查询：",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "#1180"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "docs/concepts/zh/architecture.md#provenance-3",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "issue",
      "cat-harness:section": "访问控制 —— ODRL，在每项任务前执行检查",
      "prov:value": "在 issue #1207（2026-09-23）之前，`rbac.ts` 是一套独立的 viewer < collaborator < owner 阶梯式权限，而执行器不做任何检查。现在的规范原则见 [`task-authorization`]({{ '/reference/skill-instructions/task-authorization.html' | relative_url }}) 技能。",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "#1207",
        "2026-09-23"
      ],
